              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lkraske"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this as part of a Russian themed dinner. Very good side to a hearty entree. I reduced the onion, salt and sour cream quite a bit. It was very good.",
            "datePublished": "2013-12-30T17:56:36.730Z"
          },
